# FlintTrade — journal

Read `packages/services/journal/CLAUDE.md` first. This package owns trade journal, trade logging, order analytics, and P&L tracking surfaces split from data.

## Rules
- Keep durable storage access behind `flinttrade_data` helpers.
- Do not store broker credentials, fund amounts beyond journal records, or personal IPs in logs.
- Keep audit-friendly event history deterministic and timestamped.
- Tests live in `tests/`; add focused tests for migrations and calculations.
- Update root CHANGELOG.md for user-visible journal behaviour changes.
